description=Android 16/17 LineageOS-derived ROM module (LineageOS, crDroid, Infinity-X): runtime compatibility detection for OnePlus 7: adds Wide AMOLED Gamut as a fifth native LiveDisplay profile while preserving Vivid, Natural, Cinematic and Brilliant. No APK required.
